    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56655" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέν-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>empty space, vacuum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Erasistr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gell.
				16.3.8
			</span></i> (in 
				Ion.
			form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείνωμα</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				57.17
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.31.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				36
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.655b
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>vacancy, non-existence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in Prm.</u>
			</span></i>in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				47.603
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>empty vessel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1292.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.48.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοιᾶς κ.</span>
			<i>empty shells</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.302
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Medic.,
				<i>evacuation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
