				Dsc.
				5.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.381d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>evacuant</i>, in pl., Herod.
				Med.
			in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				58.89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				116
			</span></i>.</div>
